(6425909, 953304, 129807, '<td valign="top">I really liked this... then I saw the boat. For me, that took away the feeling the image was evoking and it also keeps drawing my eye to it. Other than that, this image captures the style well.</td>', 'I really liked this... then I saw the boat. For me, that took away the feeling the image was evoking and it also keeps drawing my eye to it. Other than that, this image captures the style well.', '2011-05-27 09:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
