(6425920, 953632, 44825, '<td valign="top">Very reminiscent of ''On the Banks of the Marne''. I would like to see a B&amp;W version - I think the impact would better.</td>', 'Very reminiscent of ''On the Banks of the Marne''. I would like to see a B&W version - I think the impact would better.', '2011-05-27 09:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6425922, 953698, 129807, '<td valign="top">Excellent job at capturing the style, well done.</td>', 'Excellent job at capturing the style, well done.', '2011-05-27 09:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6425928, 953534, 129807, '<td valign="top">The more I look at this shot, the more I appreciate the composition and the way you have ''captured a moment''. I like the way my eye is drawn to the standing couple,then led out of the picture by all the elements working together. The dark tree on the left ''blocks'' you from going that way, and everything else leads you right. I like that about this shot, many will probably dislike it.</td>', 'The more I look at this shot, the more I appreciate the composition and the way you have ''captured a moment''. I like the way my eye is drawn to the standing couple,then led out of the picture by all the elements working together. The dark tree on the left ''blocks'' you from going that way, and everything else leads you right. I like that about this shot, many will probably dislike it.', '2011-05-27 09:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6425929, 953698, 19825, '<td valign="top">This has an interesting nostalgic feel. Interesting image.</td>', 'This has an interesting nostalgic feel. Interesting image.', '2011-05-27 09:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6425938, 953506, 19825, '<td valign="top">While staircases seemed to be common in HCR''s images, I don''t recall many of just architecture and no people. Maybe I missed them.</td>', 'While staircases seemed to be common in HCR''s images, I don''t recall many of just architecture and no people. Maybe I missed them.', '2011-05-27 09:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6425940, 953108, 19825, '<td valign="top">Maybe I did not dig deep enough into HCB''s portfolio, but the images I recall all had some people in them.</td>', 'Maybe I did not dig deep enough into HCB''s portfolio, but the images I recall all had some people in them.', '2011-05-27 09:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
