(6427369, 953492, 58634, '<td valign="top">Love this! I enjoy the action capture. Lighting and composition work in your favor. I also really like the textures from the walls. Yup, love this image.</td>', 'Love this! I enjoy the action capture. Lighting and composition work in your favor. I also really like the textures from the walls. Yup, love this image.', '2011-05-29 17:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
