(6427373, 953436, 58634, '<td valign="top">What an interesting capture. I like that you kept it "upside down", if you know what I mean.<br/> <br/>Edit: As far as the upside down comment goes, I guess with minimal editing, you didn''t really have an option for rotating the image, but either way, I like it. My bad!</td>', 'What an interesting capture. I like that you kept it "upside down", if you know what I mean. Edit: As far as the upside down comment goes, I guess with minimal editing, you didn''t really have an option for rotating the image, but either way, I like it. My bad!', '2011-05-29 17:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
