(6427377, 953669, 58634, '<td valign="top">I find this very interesting. Lighting and contrast is very harsh, but I prefer that over a washed out image.</td>', 'I find this very interesting. Lighting and contrast is very harsh, but I prefer that over a washed out image.', '2011-05-29 17:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
