(6427379, 953534, 58634, '<td valign="top">Nothing seems to be in focus, and I''m not sure what you''re trying to highlight in this image.</td>', 'Nothing seems to be in focus, and I''m not sure what you''re trying to highlight in this image.', '2011-05-29 17:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6427380, 953590, 58634, '<td valign="top">I like the setting and composition. It doesn''t really look like a candid shot to me though.</td>', 'I like the setting and composition. It doesn''t really look like a candid shot to me though.', '2011-05-29 17:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
