(6427401, 953557, 58634, '<td valign="top">Love this! I like the expression on their faces. Very good shot.</td>', 'Love this! I like the expression on their faces. Very good shot.', '2011-05-29 17:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6427404, 953578, 58634, '<td valign="top">How comical of them. Nice shot. Good contrast and I think the composition works.</td>', 'How comical of them. Nice shot. Good contrast and I think the composition works.', '2011-05-29 17:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6427406, 953125, 58634, '<td valign="top">Adorable!</td>', 'Adorable!', '2011-05-29 17:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6427408, 953636, 58634, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great shot. That is all.</td>', 'I think this is a great shot. That is all.', '2011-05-29 17:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6427409, 953691, 58634, '<td valign="top">I see what you were going for, but unfortunately, it doesn''t work for me. I find this washed out and nothing really pops out.</td>', 'I see what you were going for, but unfortunately, it doesn''t work for me. I find this washed out and nothing really pops out.', '2011-05-29 17:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6427410, 953173, 58634, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle and subjects.</td>', 'Interesting angle and subjects.', '2011-05-29 17:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6427412, 953231, 58634, '<td valign="top">Aren''t we all when the cops are around?</td>', 'Aren''t we all when the cops are around?', '2011-05-29 17:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6427414, 952607, 58634, '<td valign="top">If this is a complete stranger, and I''m hoping it is, I''ll say great shot!</td>', 'If this is a complete stranger, and I''m hoping it is, I''ll say great shot!', '2011-05-29 17:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6427415, 953506, 58634, '<td valign="top">Interesting shapes and angles.</td>', 'Interesting shapes and angles.', '2011-05-29 17:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6427427, 953008, 58634, '<td valign="top">I like how you captured that splashing water.</td>', 'I like how you captured that splashing water.', '2011-05-29 18:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6427428, 953701, 58634, '<td valign="top">I think this shot captures a lot of emotions.</td>', 'I think this shot captures a lot of emotions.', '2011-05-29 18:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6427429, 953632, 58634, '<td valign="top">I think you should''ve focused more on one or two individuals, rather than everyone, that way a ''moment'' would''ve been empasized by your capture.</td>', 'I think you should''ve focused more on one or two individuals, rather than everyone, that way a ''moment'' would''ve been empasized by your capture.', '2011-05-29 18:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6427430, 952691, 58634, '<td valign="top">Looks very vintage. I like the effect, and the perspective, too!</td>', 'Looks very vintage. I like the effect, and the perspective, too!', '2011-05-29 18:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6427432, 953105, 58634, '<td valign="top">How adorable is she!</td>', 'How adorable is she!', '2011-05-29 18:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6427434, 952803, 58634, '<td valign="top">Excellent timing!</td>', 'Excellent timing!', '2011-05-29 18:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6427435, 953586, 58634, '<td valign="top">I like the angle and the perspective.</td>', 'I like the angle and the perspective.', '2011-05-29 18:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6427437, 953342, 58634, '<td valign="top">This is silly, but why is the image so small? I like the composition of this image. The horizon is slightly tilted, though.</td>', 'This is silly, but why is the image so small? I like the composition of this image. The horizon is slightly tilted, though.', '2011-05-29 18:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6427681, 953691, 100831, '<td valign="top">I love the light and the independent little stories going on here. This is very much a picture about life and I think that''s what HCB was going for.</td>', 'I love the light and the independent little stories going on here. This is very much a picture about life and I think that''s what HCB was going for.', '2011-05-30 00:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6427682, 953492, 100831, '<td valign="top">In the style to a T - best in show from me - lovely lovely entry!</td>', 'In the style to a T - best in show from me - lovely lovely entry!', '2011-05-30 00:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6427915, 953601, 102315, '<td valign="top">This looks spot on to what a Bresson photo should be. Granted I''ve just learned of this photographer through this challenge but in the past week have been google imaging his work and right when this image popped up I thought that it looked exactly like the ones I''ve been looking at. Great job.</td>', 'This looks spot on to what a Bresson photo should be. Granted I''ve just learned of this photographer through this challenge but in the past week have been google imaging his work and right when this image popped up I thought that it looked exactly like the ones I''ve been looking at. Great job.', '2011-05-30 02:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6428005, 953492, 119667, '<td valign="top">excellent timing, great capture. Truly in the spirit of HCB</td>', 'excellent timing, great capture. Truly in the spirit of HCB', '2011-05-30 04:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6428010, 953492, 119419, '<td valign="top">A winner ! Wonderful.</td>', 'A winner ! Wonderful.', '2011-05-30 05:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6428015, 953436, 28742, '<td valign="top">ROFL! Great capture, BRILLIANT title! :)</td>', 'ROFL! Great capture, BRILLIANT title! :)', '2011-05-30 05:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6428024, 952740, 127021, '<td valign="top">Nice lines in the photo and the subjects are certainly waiting! i ALMOST wish there was a couple stops more light on their faces though...</td>', 'Nice lines in the photo and the subjects are certainly waiting! i ALMOST wish there was a couple stops more light on their faces though...', '2011-05-30 05:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6428025, 953557, 127021, '<td valign="top">Excellent eye contact.</td>', 'Excellent eye contact.', '2011-05-30 05:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6428349, 952751, 117474, '<td valign="top">There''s so much movement in this shot. Wonderful!</td>', 'There''s so much movement in this shot. Wonderful!', '2011-05-30 13:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6428564, 953601, 63244, '<td valign="top">Ok, I understand the "top down" aspect as Henri likes, but the shot looks a bit under exposed. For the sake of interest, IMHO, you might have placed the child more to the left side of the frame and included all of the round drain on the right in the frame (if possible). This would have complimented the round of the bucket.  I would love to see you try reshooting this and see how it turns out. As is, it tells me nothing as isn''t very interesting. Having said that, the child is quite cute! ;)</td>', 'Ok, I understand the "top down" aspect as Henri likes, but the shot looks a bit under exposed. For the sake of interest, IMHO, you might have placed the child more to the left side of the frame and included all of the round drain on the right in the frame (if possible). This would have complimented the round of the bucket.  I would love to see you try reshooting this and see how it turns out. As is, it tells me nothing as isn''t very interesting. Having said that, the child is quite cute! ;)', '2011-05-30 17:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6428572, 953648, 63244, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot and I think it works well for the challenge. The only negative is the shadow on the head of the man in the foreground. It looks like a black hole, lol. I had to zoom in to see if he had a giant eye patch! That is a minor ding! Great capture.</td>', 'I really like this shot and I think it works well for the challenge. The only negative is the shadow on the head of the man in the foreground. It looks like a black hole, lol. I had to zoom in to see if he had a giant eye patch! That is a minor ding! Great capture.', '2011-05-30 17:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6428576, 953580, 63244, '<td valign="top">The idea is good. Watch the forward/backward tipping of the camera when shooting. This will help with the perspective issues.</td>', 'The idea is good. Watch the forward/backward tipping of the camera when shooting. This will help with the perspective issues.', '2011-05-30 17:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6428583, 953672, 63244, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot!! It looks almost like she is looking through a window...to the past! I love all of the lines and the shapes. Fun capture!</td>', 'This is a great shot!! It looks almost like she is looking through a window...to the past! I love all of the lines and the shapes. Fun capture!', '2011-05-30 17:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6428586, 953578, 63244, '<td valign="top">This is so funny...looks like K-9 karaoke!</td>', 'This is so funny...looks like K-9 karaoke!', '2011-05-30 17:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6428588, 953326, 63244, '<td valign="top">Love all of the posters on the wall and the broken concrete. Timing was perfect as the light hit the jacket wonderfully! The random artwork on the posters compliments the starkness of the jacket.</td>', 'Love all of the posters on the wall and the broken concrete. Timing was perfect as the light hit the jacket wonderfully! The random artwork on the posters compliments the starkness of the jacket.', '2011-05-30 17:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6428595, 953671, 63244, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of this and the expressions. You managed the exposure quite well. Composition isn''t bad, but watch your framing. This would be far more effective had the bottom of the photo not been cut out of the shot when shooting. You don''t need all of the trees in the background. Maybe framed to go through the middle of the top branch in the upper left, still keeping part of it for effect, but including all of the feet and the wheels. Or, frame with top being directly above the bottom branch. This would also make the top of the fence not a dead center horizon. :)</td>', 'I like the simplicity of this and the expressions. You managed the exposure quite well. Composition isn''t bad, but watch your framing. This would be far more effective had the bottom of the photo not been cut out of the shot when shooting. You don''t need all of the trees in the background. Maybe framed to go through the middle of the top branch in the upper left, still keeping part of it for effect, but including all of the feet and the wheels. Or, frame with top being directly above the bottom branch. This would also make the top of the fence not a dead center horizon. :)', '2011-05-30 17:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6428605, 953188, 63244, '<td valign="top">The far left goose appears to have broken wind at the exact moment you shot this, or else you have a huge smudge on your camera lens!</td>', 'The far left goose appears to have broken wind at the exact moment you shot this, or else you have a huge smudge on your camera lens!', '2011-05-30 17:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6428853, 953433, 64086, '<td valign="top">I love the vastness, the shadows and the layers. The lens compression makes it look like the ledge is a half an inch wide. Great Job!</td>', 'I love the vastness, the shadows and the layers. The lens compression makes it look like the ledge is a half an inch wide. Great Job!', '2011-05-30 22:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6428855, 953173, 64086, '<td valign="top">Beautiful moment in time.</td>', 'Beautiful moment in time.', '2011-05-30 22:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6428857, 953674, 35545, '<td valign="top">Nice stop-action shot.  Too bad he doesn''t stand out more from the background.</td>', 'Nice stop-action shot.  Too bad he doesn''t stand out more from the background.', '2011-05-30 22:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6428858, 953171, 35545, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, but IMNSHO, needs more contrast.</td>', 'Nice capture, but IMNSHO, needs more contrast.', '2011-05-30 22:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6428860, 952809, 64086, '<td valign="top">Such a fine composition.  The low wide angle, her shadow, her pose, the water bottle, the key, the old style bike and it''s shadow...so many wonderful details all working together perfectly.</td>', 'Such a fine composition.  The low wide angle, her shadow, her pose, the water bottle, the key, the old style bike and it''s shadow...so many wonderful details all working together perfectly.', '2011-05-30 22:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6428862, 953433, 35545, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture, but IMNSHO it needs a bit more contrast -- some really black blacks.</td>', 'Excellent capture, but IMNSHO it needs a bit more contrast -- some really black blacks.', '2011-05-30 22:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6428863, 952648, 35545, '<td valign="top">Good candid, but needs more contrast.</td>', 'Good candid, but needs more contrast.', '2011-05-30 22:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6428877, 952648, 100831, '<td valign="top">Yes, this looks to be a proud and emotionally charged moment. Wonderful detail and the grayscale looks nice.</td>', 'Yes, this looks to be a proud and emotionally charged moment. Wonderful detail and the grayscale looks nice.', '2011-05-30 22:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6428878, 953579, 100831, '<td valign="top">Okay the title works well. As does the contrast. I like the compostion too. Nice work</td>', 'Okay the title works well. As does the contrast. I like the compostion too. Nice work', '2011-05-30 22:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6428887, 953626, 100831, '<td valign="top">Giacometti and Cartier-Bresson, as artist friends, were both seeking a way out of surrealism. I think this photo kind of represents the thinking during that evolving process. Even the circle by Matisse in the background adds to the image... not so much the blurry spectators but they don''t detract. <br/>I''m liking this one very much... not so much as a representational presentation of HCB but artistically biographical. I hope I''m not way off base as to what you were thinking.</td>', 'Giacometti and Cartier-Bresson, as artist friends, were both seeking a way out of surrealism. I think this photo kind of represents the thinking during that evolving process. Even the circle by Matisse in the background adds to the image... not so much the blurry spectators but they don''t detract. I''m liking this one very much... not so much as a representational presentation of HCB but artistically biographical. I hope I''m not way off base as to what you were thinking.', '2011-05-30 22:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6428888, 953337, 100831, '<td valign="top">wonderful street portrait... hope that was the intention. Love the light.</td>', 'wonderful street portrait... hope that was the intention. Love the light.', '2011-05-30 22:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6428889, 952809, 100831, '<td valign="top">Form first, then the subject. This has it right. Great image.</td>', 'Form first, then the subject. This has it right. Great image.', '2011-05-30 22:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6428943, 953171, 30982, '<td valign="top">HCB did like to find shapes and incorporate those, so this is a good catch with that in mind.  From a candid perspective, it is a bit ordinary perhaps.  From a mininal perspective, maybe just a tad too much sharpening set in camera?</td>', 'HCB did like to find shapes and incorporate those, so this is a good catch with that in mind.  From a candid perspective, it is a bit ordinary perhaps.  From a mininal perspective, maybe just a tad too much sharpening set in camera?', '2011-05-30 23:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6428946, 953668, 30982, '<td valign="top">Exquisite exposure control - very impressive in minimum.  Very good tribute to HCB''s sense of shape and design - that single line of light is wonderful!</td>', 'Exquisite exposure control - very impressive in minimum.  Very good tribute to HCB''s sense of shape and design - that single line of light is wonderful!', '2011-05-30 23:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6428947, 953105, 30982, '<td valign="top">The three most visible faces are all happy ones - the overall sense of the picture is one of fun and delight!</td>', 'The three most visible faces are all happy ones - the overall sense of the picture is one of fun and delight!', '2011-05-30 23:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6428948, 953506, 30982, '<td valign="top">Many may wonder where your "decisive moment" is, but HCB did like shape and form.  He most often incorporated that with candid moments as well, though.  Still, great detail and good exposure control in minimum.  Tad oversharpened, perhaps, but hard to get diagonals without jaggies in digital presentations at this size.</td>', 'Many may wonder where your "decisive moment" is, but HCB did like shape and form.  He most often incorporated that with candid moments as well, though.  Still, great detail and good exposure control in minimum.  Tad oversharpened, perhaps, but hard to get diagonals without jaggies in digital presentations at this size.', '2011-05-30 23:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6428953, 953052, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the laundry.  Though the leg is evident and I think I see an arm, I''d like more of the person, or at least have that be a closer view of the person.  It does have a sense of calm.</td>', 'I like the laundry.  Though the leg is evident and I think I see an arm, I''d like more of the person, or at least have that be a closer view of the person.  It does have a sense of calm.', '2011-05-30 23:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6428954, 953635, 30982, '<td valign="top">Ha!!  What fun!  Awesome title. too.  Would have been even better had you got someone coming toward the "prince".  But a good catch!!</td>', 'Ha!!  What fun!  Awesome title. too.  Would have been even better had you got someone coming toward the "prince".  But a good catch!!', '2011-05-30 23:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6428967, 953695, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good combination of shape, form, tones.  It does beg a few questions - what is in ruins?  The person or the structure?</td>', 'Good combination of shape, form, tones.  It does beg a few questions - what is in ruins?  The person or the structure?', '2011-05-31 00:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6428969, 953672, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great place to wait for a good shot - and you were rewarded!  Good exposure, in-camera processing, framing.</td>', 'Great place to wait for a good shot - and you were rewarded!  Good exposure, in-camera processing, framing.', '2011-05-31 00:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6428972, 953591, 30982, '<td valign="top">A bit desolate and rather "static" feeling.  Not much going on here and it feels that way.  An interesting collection of languages on the signs, though!</td>', 'A bit desolate and rather "static" feeling.  Not much going on here and it feels that way.  An interesting collection of languages on the signs, though!', '2011-05-31 00:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6428974, 953623, 30982, '<td valign="top">A lovely candid - very engaging, well exposed and composed.  I''m a bit unsure of the connection to HCB, other than the title in French and the shot in B&amp;W.  Then again, I''m not an expert by any means!</td>', 'A lovely candid - very engaging, well exposed and composed.  I''m a bit unsure of the connection to HCB, other than the title in French and the shot in B&W.  Then again, I''m not an expert by any means!', '2011-05-31 00:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6428979, 953491, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good tones, clarity, and I like all the lines.  A bit lacking in "decisive momentness", whatever that is.</td>', 'Good tones, clarity, and I like all the lines.  A bit lacking in "decisive momentness", whatever that is.', '2011-05-31 00:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6428981, 953173, 30982, '<td valign="top">Ah!  Wonderful catch.  The light on the faces is just right.  You get the feeling they''ve been waiting places together for more years than most of us have been around.</td>', 'Ah!  Wonderful catch.  The light on the faces is just right.  You get the feeling they''ve been waiting places together for more years than most of us have been around.', '2011-05-31 00:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6428982, 953326, 30982, '<td valign="top">A great location to stake out!  Only wish he''d been a bit more interesting in his demeanor or pose or something.  he seems sort of in-between - between steps, halfway between taking a drag, etc. and for some reason that creates an imbalance of sorts to me.  Great work with the exposure and tones in camera!</td>', 'A great location to stake out!  Only wish he''d been a bit more interesting in his demeanor or pose or something.  he seems sort of in-between - between steps, halfway between taking a drag, etc. and for some reason that creates an imbalance of sorts to me.  Great work with the exposure and tones in camera!', '2011-05-31 00:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6428985, 953558, 30982, '<td valign="top">She looks a bit grumpy - I''m gonna guess that knitting lessons won''t cheer her up.  :-)  While there may be a connection between the passerby and the sign, the space between the two creates a rather significant disconnect which leaves the photo feeling awkward and unpurposed.  The overall harshness of the light that time of day doesn''t help your case, either.</td>', 'She looks a bit grumpy - I''m gonna guess that knitting lessons won''t cheer her up.  :-)  While there may be a connection between the passerby and the sign, the space between the two creates a rather significant disconnect which leaves the photo feeling awkward and unpurposed.  The overall harshness of the light that time of day doesn''t help your case, either.', '2011-05-31 00:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6428986, 953626, 30982, '<td valign="top">The blurred passerby creates the interest for me here.  Almost as though the statue is pondering the potential for movement, as unlikely as that may be, and that is echoed by the painting beyond.  The gent on the right has no part in any of that, but his being there is not a disturbance.</td>', 'The blurred passerby creates the interest for me here.  Almost as though the statue is pondering the potential for movement, as unlikely as that may be, and that is echoed by the painting beyond.  The gent on the right has no part in any of that, but his being there is not a disturbance.', '2011-05-31 00:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6428989, 953589, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m not entirely sure what you were going for here.  An interesting "market" to be sure - definitely a different use for a Blazer.  Slice of life kinda thing?  It just feels a bit awkward to me.  Maybe you needed just a split second more of the gent approaching on the left?</td>', 'I''m not entirely sure what you were going for here.  An interesting "market" to be sure - definitely a different use for a Blazer.  Slice of life kinda thing?  It just feels a bit awkward to me.  Maybe you needed just a split second more of the gent approaching on the left?', '2011-05-31 00:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6428990, 953436, 30982, '<td valign="top">Ha!!  How entirely delightful!  And oddly, I''d just read an article about planking or I''d have no idea what the title meant.  Fascinating moment.  And aren''t you glad it wasn''t a large, recently fed bird.  Do give the sensor a swab when you get a chance.  :-)</td>', 'Ha!!  How entirely delightful!  And oddly, I''d just read an article about planking or I''d have no idea what the title meant.  Fascinating moment.  And aren''t you glad it wasn''t a large, recently fed bird.  Do give the sensor a swab when you get a chance.  :-)', '2011-05-31 00:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6428992, 953373, 30982, '<td valign="top">In the documentary style that he used a bit, yes?  A lot sharper but that''s due to the difference in equipment.  I love the trees up on the hill - nice dichotomy of the straight line obviously planted trees (order) and this fellow''s apparent plight (disorder).  While I appreciate the lines of your composition, a shot from the left of this, looking up to get more of the line of trees, might be a bit more dynamic?</td>', 'In the documentary style that he used a bit, yes?  A lot sharper but that''s due to the difference in equipment.  I love the trees up on the hill - nice dichotomy of the straight line obviously planted trees (order) and this fellow''s apparent plight (disorder).  While I appreciate the lines of your composition, a shot from the left of this, looking up to get more of the line of trees, might be a bit more dynamic?', '2011-05-31 00:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6428993, 952607, 30982, '<td valign="top">Makes me smile!  Johanna and The Hand.  :-)</td>', 'Makes me smile!  Johanna and The Hand.  :-)', '2011-05-31 00:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6428994, 952965, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice vignettes of stories here.  The boredom of the two on the right - or at least contemplation.  The lone cup of coffee - to whom did it belong?  The person whose jacket matches the stool tops.  Nice slice of life shot.</td>', 'Nice vignettes of stories here.  The boredom of the two on the right - or at least contemplation.  The lone cup of coffee - to whom did it belong?  The person whose jacket matches the stool tops.  Nice slice of life shot.', '2011-05-31 00:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6428995, 952766, 30982, '<td valign="top">A nice quiet moment captured.  Maybe a bit flat but that''s the light you had to work with.  Might not have a large dose of "decisive momentness".</td>', 'A nice quiet moment captured.  Maybe a bit flat but that''s the light you had to work with.  Might not have a large dose of "decisive momentness".', '2011-05-31 00:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6428997, 953602, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m not familiar with all of HCB''s work, so I''m sure he might have done some coastline/seascape kinda things.  Just not something I''d associate him with.</td>', 'I''m not familiar with all of HCB''s work, so I''m sure he might have done some coastline/seascape kinda things.  Just not something I''d associate him with.', '2011-05-31 00:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6428998, 953472, 30982, '<td valign="top">Lots of feet!  Interesting layout of the feet.  But most would generally want some faces to go with those feet.  Though from what I see, I''m going to guess it''s a church function of some kind.  Don''t ask me why I get that impression.  Anyway, I generally associate HCB with including more of the faces for the most part.</td>', 'Lots of feet!  Interesting layout of the feet.  But most would generally want some faces to go with those feet.  Though from what I see, I''m going to guess it''s a church function of some kind.  Don''t ask me why I get that impression.  Anyway, I generally associate HCB with including more of the faces for the most part.', '2011-05-31 00:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6429000, 952803, 30982, '<td valign="top">Hope no models were injured during the making of this photograph!  And while you did capture a ''moment'', it doesn''t carry a lot of impact (other than to Allison just moments after this!) to the viewer (ie me.)</td>', 'Hope no models were injured during the making of this photograph!  And while you did capture a ''moment'', it doesn''t carry a lot of impact (other than to Allison just moments after this!) to the viewer (ie me.)', '2011-05-31 00:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6429001, 953198, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like just the hint of the guy on the right, and the way the wording on the window lines up with the table.  Unfortunate position of her pinkie finger.</td>', 'I like just the hint of the guy on the right, and the way the wording on the window lines up with the table.  Unfortunate position of her pinkie finger.', '2011-05-31 00:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6429002, 953578, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOL!  I can hear them singing!  They''re loud, they''re out of key, and they don''t mind at all.  What enthusiasm!  Great work with the exposure.</td>', 'LOL!  I can hear them singing!  They''re loud, they''re out of key, and they don''t mind at all.  What enthusiasm!  Great work with the exposure.', '2011-05-31 00:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6429004, 953342, 30982, '<td valign="top">A nice view, but a bit plain and static - HCB tended to find shape and form that gave energy to his captures.</td>', 'A nice view, but a bit plain and static - HCB tended to find shape and form that gave energy to his captures.', '2011-05-31 00:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6429005, 953579, 30982, '<td valign="top">Maybe a bit too cramped and (I hate to use this word, because all my pictures are this way) busy.  I do like how the heads on the poster are hidden by the sign, as the shopkeeper is hidden by the overhang.  But too much else in the frame takes away from that.</td>', 'Maybe a bit too cramped and (I hate to use this word, because all my pictures are this way) busy.  I do like how the heads on the poster are hidden by the sign, as the shopkeeper is hidden by the overhang.  But too much else in the frame takes away from that.', '2011-05-31 00:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6429006, 953627, 30982, '<td valign="top">A potential title would be "Huh?" as that seems to be what she is indicating.  Or possibly "What do you want?"  Not really "momentish" per se but an intersting use of the shapes/forms of the building.</td>', 'A potential title would be "Huh?" as that seems to be what she is indicating.  Or possibly "What do you want?"  Not really "momentish" per se but an intersting use of the shapes/forms of the building.', '2011-05-31 00:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6429008, 952751, 30982, '<td valign="top">A nice change of perspective!  Interesting textures and lines.  Would like to have seen an interaction of some kind between the musician and the passers-by.</td>', 'A nice change of perspective!  Interesting textures and lines.  Would like to have seen an interaction of some kind between the musician and the passers-by.', '2011-05-31 00:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6429009, 953125, 30982, '<td valign="top">Cute - she seems to be taking very good care of that bear.  I like the angle - gives it a bit more energy.  Not sure if it is HCB "moment"ish or not, but it appears to be a good momento from the day.</td>', 'Cute - she seems to be taking very good care of that bear.  I like the angle - gives it a bit more energy.  Not sure if it is HCB "moment"ish or not, but it appears to be a good momento from the day.', '2011-05-31 00:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6429011, 953625, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like how the guy by the lamp essentially has no shadow.  Does that make him a vampire?  Can''t be - it''s broad daylight!  Zombie?  Witch??</td>', 'I like how the guy by the lamp essentially has no shadow.  Does that make him a vampire?  Can''t be - it''s broad daylight!  Zombie?  Witch??', '2011-05-31 00:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6429013, 953584, 30982, '<td valign="top">They seem to be enjoying the day, don''t they?  Seems to be a bit of a quick snap - trying not to get caught kind of thing - which is not necessarily a bad thing (I do it all the time).  But this doesn''t seem to have a lot of coherence to it if that makes sense.</td>', 'They seem to be enjoying the day, don''t they?  Seems to be a bit of a quick snap - trying not to get caught kind of thing - which is not necessarily a bad thing (I do it all the time).  But this doesn''t seem to have a lot of coherence to it if that makes sense.', '2011-05-31 00:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6429014, 953353, 30982, '<td valign="top">Ha ha!  Made me laugh out loud.  Love the old-time feel to this.  And the "what the heck?" reaction it engenders.  Fun catch!!</td>', 'Ha ha!  Made me laugh out loud.  Love the old-time feel to this.  And the "what the heck?" reaction it engenders.  Fun catch!!', '2011-05-31 00:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6429015, 953590, 30982, '<td valign="top">An homage to the gent leaping the puddle, perhaps?  I do worry that she''ll break an ankle on landing, given the height of those heels!  Has a very "set up" feel to it which strikes me as not exactly HCB-ish.</td>', 'An homage to the gent leaping the puddle, perhaps?  I do worry that she''ll break an ankle on landing, given the height of those heels!  Has a very "set up" feel to it which strikes me as not exactly HCB-ish.', '2011-05-31 00:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6429016, 953671, 30982, '<td valign="top">An interesting moment in time kinda shot.  I like the enterprising adaptation to the young man''s wheelchair.</td>', 'An interesting moment in time kinda shot.  I like the enterprising adaptation to the young man''s wheelchair.', '2011-05-31 00:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6429019, 953055, 30982, '<td valign="top">That''s one bright jacket!  I appreciate the folks in blur - it''s one of my favorite things to do.  They just seem so gray and lifeless here, despite their movement.  Zombies, maybe?  And that guy in the jacket is the last survivor, watching them all go buy...</td>', 'That''s one bright jacket!  I appreciate the folks in blur - it''s one of my favorite things to do.  They just seem so gray and lifeless here, despite their movement.  Zombies, maybe?  And that guy in the jacket is the last survivor, watching them all go buy...', '2011-05-31 01:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6429021, 952691, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice light on the lines.  Has an oldish feel to it, too.  Not quite sure of the HCB connection but I''m not versed on his whole catalog.</td>', 'Nice light on the lines.  Has an oldish feel to it, too.  Not quite sure of the HCB connection but I''m not versed on his whole catalog.', '2011-05-31 01:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6429024, 953507, 30982, '<td valign="top">Cute and fun!  Gotta love the flying pigtail.  And I don''t know how you did it, but that sweater looks as though it has a taste of color in it.  Enjoyable photograph.</td>', 'Cute and fun!  Gotta love the flying pigtail.  And I don''t know how you did it, but that sweater looks as though it has a taste of color in it.  Enjoyable photograph.', '2011-05-31 01:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6429026, 953337, 30982, '<td valign="top">Kind of a random headshot of a guy with no real context to it.  HCB had a tendency to capture people in places, doing things, etc, to give a bit more context - at least that''s how I think of his work.</td>', 'Kind of a random headshot of a guy with no real context to it.  HCB had a tendency to capture people in places, doing things, etc, to give a bit more context - at least that''s how I think of his work.', '2011-05-31 01:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6429027, 953576, 30982, '<td valign="top">A nice place to wait for a shot - I like the guys dancing on the wall.  A person simply walking in seems a bit average, though.</td>', 'A nice place to wait for a shot - I like the guys dancing on the wall.  A person simply walking in seems a bit average, though.', '2011-05-31 01:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6429028, 953688, 30982, '<td valign="top">Interesting title, as he does seem to be contemplating the lock.  He''s been to a good shelter or facility at some point, though, because he has very good shoes.</td>', 'Interesting title, as he does seem to be contemplating the lock.  He''s been to a good shelter or facility at some point, though, because he has very good shoes.', '2011-05-31 01:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6429030, 952963, 30982, '<td valign="top">HCB did have a thing for form and shapes - the centered comp, with the tall kid in the middle, is offset every so nicely by the i and ii of the remaining structures on the sides of the road.</td>', 'HCB did have a thing for form and shapes - the centered comp, with the tall kid in the middle, is offset every so nicely by the i and ii of the remaining structures on the sides of the road.', '2011-05-31 01:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6429031, 953586, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice triangles here - notedly the one formed by her, him and him (moving clockwise in the frame); the triangle formed by the white lines and the front left corner of the frame.  A good homage to the way HCB would find shapes and structure in his captures.</td>', 'Nice triangles here - notedly the one formed by her, him and him (moving clockwise in the frame); the triangle formed by the white lines and the front left corner of the frame.  A good homage to the way HCB would find shapes and structure in his captures.', '2011-05-31 01:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6429033, 953678, 30982, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit of a "I''ll sneak up and shoot him and he''ll never notice" kind of thing, doesn''t it?  HCB tended to get his subjects engaged in something, even with him at times.  The tones in this are very good, but it lacks some of the energy HCB seemed to find.</td>', 'Seems a bit of a "I''ll sneak up and shoot him and he''ll never notice" kind of thing, doesn''t it?  HCB tended to get his subjects engaged in something, even with him at times.  The tones in this are very good, but it lacks some of the energy HCB seemed to find.', '2011-05-31 01:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6429034, 953402, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh!  A nice moment of fun.  One does wonder "why the handstand"?</td>', 'Heh!  A nice moment of fun.  One does wonder "why the handstand"?', '2011-05-31 01:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6429035, 953439, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent exposure control and very good in-camera framing, sharpening, contrast, etc.  I''m sure there''s some analogy (walking into the light?) one can attribute to this, but I appreciate it mostly for thelight, the crossed lines of the braces, the circle.  Very nice use of form and structure.</td>', 'Excellent exposure control and very good in-camera framing, sharpening, contrast, etc.  I''m sure there''s some analogy (walking into the light?) one can attribute to this, but I appreciate it mostly for thelight, the crossed lines of the braces, the circle.  Very nice use of form and structure.', '2011-05-31 01:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6429042, 953304, 30982, '<td valign="top">Something about the way they both are sitting conveys their relationship.  And yet both are involved in their own activities.  I could care less about the moving craft, so I''m not entirely sure why you chose to highlight it with your title.</td>', 'Something about the way they both are sitting conveys their relationship.  And yet both are involved in their own activities.  I could care less about the moving craft, so I''m not entirely sure why you chose to highlight it with your title.', '2011-05-31 01:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6429043, 953691, 30982, '<td valign="top">An interesting random grouping of folks.  Like the guy with the dog, and the little "6" sign off to the right.</td>', 'An interesting random grouping of folks.  Like the guy with the dog, and the little "6" sign off to the right.', '2011-05-31 01:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6429044, 953005, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the busy-ness of the alley - the meters, the vents, etc.  The person feels a bit staged in all that.</td>', 'I like the busy-ness of the alley - the meters, the vents, etc.  The person feels a bit staged in all that.', '2011-05-31 01:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6429045, 953557, 30982, '<td valign="top">A nice "got caught" kinda capture.  I like the guy out of frame.  A bit "crunchy" - sharpening set quite high in camera?  Well framed.</td>', 'A nice "got caught" kinda capture.  I like the guy out of frame.  A bit "crunchy" - sharpening set quite high in camera?  Well framed.', '2011-05-31 01:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6429046, 953628, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m sure this might be more meaningful to me if I were into or understood baseball.  I''m not sure I get why they are all standing, or if there is significance to that.</td>', 'I''m sure this might be more meaningful to me if I were into or understood baseball.  I''m not sure I get why they are all standing, or if there is significance to that.', '2011-05-31 01:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6429047, 953674, 30982, '<td valign="top">I find myself drawn more to the folks over by the fence than the boarder doing the trick.  Not sure why - maybe because he blends in with the background a bit too much?  I do like the guy casually watching.</td>', 'I find myself drawn more to the folks over by the fence than the boarder doing the trick.  Not sure why - maybe because he blends in with the background a bit too much?  I do like the guy casually watching.', '2011-05-31 01:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6429048, 953188, 30982, '<td valign="top">Chilly!  I like the booties.  Not sure what the blob in the lower left is.</td>', 'Chilly!  I like the booties.  Not sure what the blob in the lower left is.', '2011-05-31 01:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6429049, 952631, 30982, '<td valign="top">I can''t walk while reading... I''d run into things.  He seems to be doing fairly well, though.  A bit lacking in the whole "decisive moment" HCB thing but a good candid.</td>', 'I can''t walk while reading... I''d run into things.  He seems to be doing fairly well, though.  A bit lacking in the whole "decisive moment" HCB thing but a good candid.', '2011-05-31 01:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6429050, 953440, 30982, '<td valign="top">Not sure I get this, but it''s kind of interesting in a quirky, odd sort of way.  Heels on the beach?</td>', 'Not sure I get this, but it''s kind of interesting in a quirky, odd sort of way.  Heels on the beach?', '2011-05-31 01:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6429051, 953231, 30982, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.  I think I see your point with the title (waiting for the light to cross) but I''m not sure it makes for a particularly impactful or meaningful photograph to me.  Interesting bits to explore, though - the glow of "WAY in Subway - what''s up with that?  And the arm hanging out of the police car...  A bit blotchy - a cell phone camera, maybe?</td>', 'Hmmm.  I think I see your point with the title (waiting for the light to cross) but I''m not sure it makes for a particularly impactful or meaningful photograph to me.  Interesting bits to explore, though - the glow of "WAY in Subway - what''s up with that?  And the arm hanging out of the police car...  A bit blotchy - a cell phone camera, maybe?', '2011-05-31 01:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6429052, 953684, 30982, '<td valign="top">What''s with all the French titles?  I missed the memo on that...<br/> <br/>Anyway, love the dog.  Is he tied to the cart?  What does the cart offer?  Where is the dog''s person?  The sign says available 7 days a week - the person had better be there!</td>', 'What''s with all the French titles?  I missed the memo on that... Anyway, love the dog.  Is he tied to the cart?  What does the cart offer?  Where is the dog''s person?  The sign says available 7 days a week - the person had better be there!', '2011-05-31 01:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6429053, 953588, 30982, '<td valign="top">Not exactly sure what you''re going for here.  Good legs, maybe?  :-)  A bit oversharpened to me.</td>', 'Not exactly sure what you''re going for here.  Good legs, maybe?  :-)  A bit oversharpened to me.', '2011-05-31 01:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6429054, 953184, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I get the link to HCB with this.  The "moment" arriving at home, perhaps?  The expressions don''t say much to me, though.</td>', 'I''m not sure I get the link to HCB with this.  The "moment" arriving at home, perhaps?  The expressions don''t say much to me, though.', '2011-05-31 01:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6429055, 953292, 30982, '<td valign="top">A gritty slice of life kinda shot.  I like the overlap of XXXX and Room...</td>', 'A gritty slice of life kinda shot.  I like the overlap of XXXX and Room...', '2011-05-31 01:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6429056, 953278, 30982, '<td valign="top">Sadly, the little fellow (or gal) gets a little lost here.  It might have been more of a "story" so to speak had you been able to get away from the trash can on the left (I think that''s what it is) and had the gent in the t-shirt been elsewhere.  Candids, in my experience, are a whole lot of trial and error and waiting.</td>', 'Sadly, the little fellow (or gal) gets a little lost here.  It might have been more of a "story" so to speak had you been able to get away from the trash can on the left (I think that''s what it is) and had the gent in the t-shirt been elsewhere.  Candids, in my experience, are a whole lot of trial and error and waiting.', '2011-05-31 01:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6429057, 953152, 30982, '<td valign="top">What a great group of characters.  Nice HCB-ish with respect to some of the documentary work he did.</td>', 'What a great group of characters.  Nice HCB-ish with respect to some of the documentary work he did.', '2011-05-31 01:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6429058, 953433, 30982, '<td valign="top">Odd and interesting and a wonderful collection of shapes, textures, and form.</td>', 'Odd and interesting and a wonderful collection of shapes, textures, and form.', '2011-05-31 01:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6429059, 953108, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m certainly not an expert on HCB but I don''t see how this relates to the style he''s known by.</td>', 'I''m certainly not an expert on HCB but I don''t see how this relates to the style he''s known by.', '2011-05-31 01:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6429060, 953556, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the frozen moment element of this, with each doing something here.  The affected lass on the left (is she with them?  There for some other reason?).  The bride handing off the bouquet (or taking it back).  The gent with the inexplicably tight pants working the equipment.  The groom, nearly hidden by the bride, his attention elsewhere.</td>', 'I like the frozen moment element of this, with each doing something here.  The affected lass on the left (is she with them?  There for some other reason?).  The bride handing off the bouquet (or taking it back).  The gent with the inexplicably tight pants working the equipment.  The groom, nearly hidden by the bride, his attention elsewhere.', '2011-05-31 01:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6429061, 953377, 30982, '<td valign="top">For some reason, Charlie Chaplin came to mind when this opened.  Not sure that''s what you were going for, though.  A bit strange juxtaposition of the alley and the tails.</td>', 'For some reason, Charlie Chaplin came to mind when this opened.  Not sure that''s what you were going for, though.  A bit strange juxtaposition of the alley and the tails.', '2011-05-31 01:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6429062, 953534, 30982, '<td valign="top">Has a bit of a "sneak" feel to this - nothing wrong with that except when it doesn''t quite work.  The two apparently live people seem rather disaffected.  The statue appears to be a statue, though who knows - there are live statues everywhere working for tips.  Not sure of the persons on the right edge - were they meant to be there, and for what?  Or just a consequence of the framing?</td>', 'Has a bit of a "sneak" feel to this - nothing wrong with that except when it doesn''t quite work.  The two apparently live people seem rather disaffected.  The statue appears to be a statue, though who knows - there are live statues everywhere working for tips.  Not sure of the persons on the right edge - were they meant to be there, and for what?  Or just a consequence of the framing?', '2011-05-31 01:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6429064, 953546, 30982, '<td valign="top">Without reading your title, the first thought I had was "a guy boarding a boat".  And that seems to be all I get from this.  I guess one might wonder where he''s going, or what the gent standing there looking bored is there for.  But overall it doesn''t really invite me to come back and revisit it later, if that makes sense.</td>', 'Without reading your title, the first thought I had was "a guy boarding a boat".  And that seems to be all I get from this.  I guess one might wonder where he''s going, or what the gent standing there looking bored is there for.  But overall it doesn''t really invite me to come back and revisit it later, if that makes sense.', '2011-05-31 02:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6429066, 953601, 30982, '<td valign="top">Kinda reminds me of that lady who photographs kids in flower pots.  Great eyes on the kid!</td>', 'Kinda reminds me of that lady who photographs kids in flower pots.  Great eyes on the kid!', '2011-05-31 02:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6429067, 952663, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen lots of "sneak attacks" in this challenge, but this is one that works better than most.  You did catch a nice moment between the two.</td>', 'I''ve seen lots of "sneak attacks" in this challenge, but this is one that works better than most.  You did catch a nice moment between the two.', '2011-05-31 02:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6429069, 953470, 30982, '<td valign="top">I see the resemblance in her stance to that of the "instructional placard" on the bin.  But it''s a bit too far away against a cluttered background to really stand out well, and other than being a great public service announcement, doesn''t really strike me as a "keeper" per se.</td>', 'I see the resemblance in her stance to that of the "instructional placard" on the bin.  But it''s a bit too far away against a cluttered background to really stand out well, and other than being a great public service announcement, doesn''t really strike me as a "keeper" per se.', '2011-05-31 02:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6429070, 953580, 30982, '<td valign="top">Gotta wonder what he''s cuffed for, huh?  Is the guy on the left wearing a glove of some kind?   Carrying a purse?  Darn cars.  They''re really annoying in the way they get in the way all the time!  Framing could have been a bit better, maybe.</td>', 'Gotta wonder what he''s cuffed for, huh?  Is the guy on the left wearing a glove of some kind?   Carrying a purse?  Darn cars.  They''re really annoying in the way they get in the way all the time!  Framing could have been a bit better, maybe.', '2011-05-31 02:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6429071, 952809, 30982, '<td valign="top">Yes, shapes indeed.  Do women really stand that way?  I suppose they do.</td>', 'Yes, shapes indeed.  Do women really stand that way?  I suppose they do.', '2011-05-31 02:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6429073, 953492, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wonderful to catch both feet off the ground!  Feels as though it''s very old school (except I don''t think old-school bags had handles).  Marvelous textures, light.  Very much the "decisive moment" to me.<br/> <br/>Back.  This was the tenth photo I viewed for this challenge.  It is the best homage to HCB and I suspect blue ribbon.  Excellent work.</td>', 'Wonderful to catch both feet off the ground!  Feels as though it''s very old school (except I don''t think old-school bags had handles).  Marvelous textures, light.  Very much the "decisive moment" to me. Back.  This was the tenth photo I viewed for this challenge.  It is the best homage to HCB and I suspect blue ribbon.  Excellent work.', '2011-05-31 02:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6429128, 953492, 97559, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, I like the tones and the how the boy is running. It gives the picture a dynamic and urgent feel.</td>', 'Nice shot, I like the tones and the how the boy is running. It gives the picture a dynamic and urgent feel.', '2011-05-31 03:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
