(6429645, 953671, 114225, '<td valign="top">The teddy bear backpack is hilarious :)<br/>I like the way the lines work in this image. The guy standing merges with the fence to make the sitting guy really stand out.</td>', 'The teddy bear backpack is hilarious :)I like the way the lines work in this image. The guy standing merges with the fence to make the sitting guy really stand out.', '2011-05-31 17:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
