(6430446, 953173, 18073, '<td valign="top">Just a touch too much contrast for me as I cannot easily see the expression on the old ladies face, over all I like the shot though.  Really like the expression on the old chaps face.<br/> <br/>I am sure I recognise this location too, looks like my local bus depot, will be interested to see where you are from after this contest ends  :)</td>', 'Just a touch too much contrast for me as I cannot easily see the expression on the old ladies face, over all I like the shot though.  Really like the expression on the old chaps face. I am sure I recognise this location too, looks like my local bus depot, will be interested to see where you are from after this contest ends  :)', '2011-06-01 08:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6430463, 952607, 18073, '<td valign="top">Really like this shot a lot, perfect exposure and contrast for my taste.  Love the smiling face and the addition of the chap holding his head just adds to the ''story''.<br/> <br/>Makes you wonder what the joke was :)<br/> <br/>The only thing nagging me here is that I think having the ladies head more off center would of made a better composition, overall though, I like this.  Good job!</td>', 'Really like this shot a lot, perfect exposure and contrast for my taste.  Love the smiling face and the addition of the chap holding his head just adds to the ''story''. Makes you wonder what the joke was :) The only thing nagging me here is that I think having the ladies head more off center would of made a better composition, overall though, I like this.  Good job!', '2011-06-01 08:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
