(6432221, 952691, 108069, '<td valign="top">Nice! Great contrast, lines, the haze is beautiful. I hope people don''t overlook this.</td>', 'Nice! Great contrast, lines, the haze is beautiful. I hope people don''t overlook this.', '2011-06-02 21:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6432223, 953668, 108069, '<td valign="top">Wow, I had a similar shot I was thinking of entering but there were too many flaws. But this is quite well done. I have to give you props just because we apparently think the same. I''m sorry for you!!!</td>', 'Wow, I had a similar shot I was thinking of entering but there were too many flaws. But this is quite well done. I have to give you props just because we apparently think the same. I''m sorry for you!!!', '2011-06-02 22:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6432224, 953154, 108069, '<td valign="top">Excellent stuff.</td>', 'Excellent stuff.', '2011-06-02 22:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6432226, 953492, 108069, '<td valign="top">Magnificent stuff. I''ve returned to this throughout the week and it''s a favorite.</td>', 'Magnificent stuff. I''ve returned to this throughout the week and it''s a favorite.', '2011-06-02 22:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6432232, 953433, 108069, '<td valign="top">Such a great capture. One of my favorites.</td>', 'Such a great capture. One of my favorites.', '2011-06-02 22:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6432236, 953353, 108069, '<td valign="top">Funny and clever and very well done. Has that old feel to it as well. (I tried that but I messed it up and it just was too gimmicky to enter). But this is fantastic.<br/> <br/>Also, what instantly springs to mind is a Guinness ad, which for starters is a good thing, but more importantly it''s the celebration of life that I think HCB was quite adept at recording.</td>', 'Funny and clever and very well done. Has that old feel to it as well. (I tried that but I messed it up and it just was too gimmicky to enter). But this is fantastic. Also, what instantly springs to mind is a Guinness ad, which for starters is a good thing, but more importantly it''s the celebration of life that I think HCB was quite adept at recording.', '2011-06-02 22:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6432265, 953492, 76335, '<td valign="top">Now <i>this</i> feels like HCB -- or maybe Ronis. Same tradition...</td>', 'Now this feels like HCB -- or maybe Ronis. Same tradition...', '2011-06-02 22:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6432266, 953632, 76335, '<td valign="top">Very interesting. I wish it were a bit sharper but the variety and arrangement of people here is what matters.</td>', 'Very interesting. I wish it were a bit sharper but the variety and arrangement of people here is what matters.', '2011-06-02 22:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6432267, 953648, 76335, '<td valign="top">Some interesting characters on stage...</td>', 'Some interesting characters on stage...', '2011-06-02 22:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6432268, 953154, 76335, '<td valign="top">Candid, intimate, real. Nicely done.</td>', 'Candid, intimate, real. Nicely done.', '2011-06-02 22:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6432269, 953433, 76335, '<td valign="top">Finally -- something in this challenge that I can sink my teeth into...</td>', 'Finally -- something in this challenge that I can sink my teeth into...', '2011-06-02 22:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6432270, 953173, 76335, '<td valign="top">Good tension in this one. There are stories in those fleeting expressions.</td>', 'Good tension in this one. There are stories in those fleeting expressions.', '2011-06-02 22:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6432271, 952751, 76335, '<td valign="top">More like Kertesz (or perhaps even Decarava) than HCB. But not too far off.</td>', 'More like Kertesz (or perhaps even Decarava) than HCB. But not too far off.', '2011-06-02 22:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6432272, 953702, 76335, '<td valign="top">Probably staged but I''m not factoring it into my score. Well composed, intriguing.</td>', 'Probably staged but I''m not factoring it into my score. Well composed, intriguing.', '2011-06-02 22:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6432273, 953698, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like it -- feel like it needs a little something else though -- an unruly child, a funny hat.</td>', 'I like it -- feel like it needs a little something else though -- an unruly child, a funny hat.', '2011-06-02 22:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6432274, 953590, 76335, '<td valign="top">Clearly posed, but closer to HCB than anything I''ve seen so far.</td>', 'Clearly posed, but closer to HCB than anything I''ve seen so far.', '2011-06-02 22:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6432275, 953635, 76335, '<td valign="top">Kind of corny. But I laughed.</td>', 'Kind of corny. But I laughed.', '2011-06-02 22:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6432276, 952607, 76335, '<td valign="top">This I rather like...</td>', 'This I rather like...', '2011-06-02 22:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6432277, 953666, 76335, '<td valign="top">The geometry and motion blur suggest HCB. Wish the figure on stage right weren''t clipped by the edge of the frame.</td>', 'The geometry and motion blur suggest HCB. Wish the figure on stage right weren''t clipped by the edge of the frame.', '2011-06-02 22:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6432279, 953052, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like the layers which culminate with the reclining human. It''s a lot of work though, and the reward is small.</td>', 'I like the layers which culminate with the reclining human. It''s a lot of work though, and the reward is small.', '2011-06-02 22:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6432280, 953105, 76335, '<td valign="top">Not bad. Would like to see more faces. And you seem far away.</td>', 'Not bad. Would like to see more faces. And you seem far away.', '2011-06-02 22:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6432282, 953557, 76335, '<td valign="top">Feels like you''re a block away.<br/> <br/>ETA: I''m trying to lighten up a bit. I do like the faces. Depending on what kind of platform you were on, getting closer might not have been an option. The mystery arm with the mystery drink is forgiveable, I guess.</td>', 'Feels like you''re a block away. ETA: I''m trying to lighten up a bit. I do like the faces. Depending on what kind of platform you were on, getting closer might not have been an option. The mystery arm with the mystery drink is forgiveable, I guess.', '2011-06-02 22:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6432283, 953579, 76335, '<td valign="top">Interesting geometry, and I rather like how the shapes are all flattened around the half-faced figure. I don''t think HCB used a telephoto lens though.</td>', 'Interesting geometry, and I rather like how the shapes are all flattened around the half-faced figure. I don''t think HCB used a telephoto lens though.', '2011-06-02 22:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6432305, 953439, 86447, '<td valign="top">Oh.  Wonderful! 8</td>', 'Oh.  Wonderful! 8', '2011-06-02 22:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6432316, 953507, 39057, '<td valign="top">This should win.<br/> <br/>Back again...there are very few that SHOULD come in ahead of this. However, you can''t be sure of anything on DPC. If you are in the 6.6+ range then you have a chance at a ribbon.</td>', 'This should win. Back again...there are very few that SHOULD come in ahead of this. However, you can''t be sure of anything on DPC. If you are in the 6.6+ range then you have a chance at a ribbon.', '2011-06-02 23:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6432317, 953439, 103142, '<td valign="top">I hope this is doing well for you. I really like this one! (it would have been an 8 from me. :)</td>', 'I hope this is doing well for you. I really like this one! (it would have been an 8 from me. :)', '2011-06-02 23:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6432328, 953636, 103142, '<td valign="top">Now there''s a moment! Great find. 9 (voted earlier)</td>', 'Now there''s a moment! Great find. 9 (voted earlier)', '2011-06-02 23:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6432329, 953701, 103142, '<td valign="top">Wonderful catch! 9 (voted earlier)</td>', 'Wonderful catch! 9 (voted earlier)', '2011-06-02 23:16:50.000000', NULL, 1);
