(6432948, 953173, 124815, '<td valign="top">I think that you chose well over the outtakes although <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=955109" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/102278/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_955109.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/102278/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_955109.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/102278/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_955109.jpg"/></a> is excellent also.<br/>You chose between the distant dignity of the old man over its occasional goofy side. <br/>They lived to see a lot and waited for things to happen and it took some struggle to accept them and the woman remains solid in her serenity and faith.<br/> <br/>I always weave a story around an image. Be kind with my rambling.</td>', 'I think that you chose well over the outtakes although  is excellent also.You chose between the distant dignity of the old man over its occasional goofy side. They lived to see a lot and waited for things to happen and it took some struggle to accept them and the woman remains solid in her serenity and faith. I always weave a story around an image. Be kind with my rambling.', '2011-06-03 09:05:28.000000', NULL, 0),
