(6433144, 953671, 66384, '<td valign="top">Didn''t mind the missing bottom, but there does seem to be a bit too much on top, which doesn''t add anything to the composition. I didn''t take that into consideration when I gave this image an 8. I think a lot of voters overlooked minor technical problems because of the minimal editing rule.<br/> <br/>This is a fascinating photo, since it is such an odd configuration for a wheel chair, and as you said, the teddy bear backpack. I seems so much less personal to pull it this way, than to be close behind pushing, almost in contact with the rider.</td>', 'Didn''t mind the missing bottom, but there does seem to be a bit too much on top, which doesn''t add anything to the composition. I didn''t take that into consideration when I gave this image an 8. I think a lot of voters overlooked minor technical problems because of the minimal editing rule. This is a fascinating photo, since it is such an odd configuration for a wheel chair, and as you said, the teddy bear backpack. I seems so much less personal to pull it this way, than to be close behind pushing, almost in contact with the rider.', '2011-06-03 12:30:36.000000', NULL, 0),
