(6433173, 953076, 66384, '<td valign="top">Look at you -- a second ribbon!!! Congratulations. I love this shot -- great catch. I''m glad it won.</td>', 'Look at you -- a second ribbon!!! Congratulations. I love this shot -- great catch. I''m glad it won.', '2011-06-03 12:50:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(6433192, 953492, 66384, '<td valign="top">As I said before, this was by far and away my favorite of the challenge. I never doubted for a minute that it would finish in first place. Congratulations.<br/> <br/>Thanks for sharing your camera settings. I have never used in-camera b/w conversion, because I was afraid it would take away my ability to decide on how best to convert it. I see here, that when used properly, the in-camera conversion works beautifully. And this is really the answer to shooting b/w for a minimal editing challenge.</td>', 'As I said before, this was by far and away my favorite of the challenge. I never doubted for a minute that it would finish in first place. Congratulations. Thanks for sharing your camera settings. I have never used in-camera b/w conversion, because I was afraid it would take away my ability to decide on how best to convert it. I see here, that when used properly, the in-camera conversion works beautifully. And this is really the answer to shooting b/w for a minimal editing challenge.', '2011-06-03 12:58:38.000000', NULL, 0),
