(6434993, 953433, 40391, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Steve on a well deserved ribbon.<br/> <br/>I have a confession to make.  I submitted a ticket on your image as I suspected a rule violation (probably my third or fourth ever) as the aspect ratio seemed to be different from most entries and the bricks seemed to be very level if it was captured by hand.  I suspected a rotation and crop was achieved.  Glad to see this wasnt the case and it was just very well taken.  Well done!<br/> <br/>Oh, by the way, I gave this an 8 and my second highest vote for the challenge.<br/></td>', 'Congratulations Steve on a well deserved ribbon. I have a confession to make.  I submitted a ticket on your image as I suspected a rule violation (probably my third or fourth ever) as the aspect ratio seemed to be different from most entries and the bricks seemed to be very level if it was captured by hand.  I suspected a rotation and crop was achieved.  Glad to see this wasnt the case and it was just very well taken.  Well done! Oh, by the way, I gave this an 8 and my second highest vote for the challenge.', '2011-06-05 22:41:37.000000', NULL, 0),
