(6676022, 953492, 141542, '<td valign="top">Jagar,<br/> <br/>I came back to this image while I was looking at another portfolio and wanted to say this about it, and believe me, I speak the truth.<br/> <br/>When I think of HCB and what he would do in a situation, I think of many of his images while I''m standing at the street corner, or waiting an hour for the right person to step into the scene.<br/> <br/>I also think of this image...but, and this is where I must be honest, I often forget that this shot does not belong to Henri...it belongs to you!  I literally get you and HCB confused.<br/> <br/>If someone ever said the latter to me, I can''t imagine how I''d feel, so just know that I find this to be an amazing image, and one that I think of daily as an example of the finest street photography.</td>', 'Jagar, I came back to this image while I was looking at another portfolio and wanted to say this about it, and believe me, I speak the truth. When I think of HCB and what he would do in a situation, I think of many of his images while I''m standing at the street corner, or waiting an hour for the right person to step into the scene. I also think of this image...but, and this is where I must be honest, I often forget that this shot does not belong to Henri...it belongs to you!  I literally get you and HCB confused. If someone ever said the latter to me, I can''t imagine how I''d feel, so just know that I find this to be an amazing image, and one that I think of daily as an example of the finest street photography.', '2012-02-14 09:44:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(6784906, 953492, 127021, '<td valign="top">ok it''s been more than a year since this challenge but this photo has always been rattling around in my head, especially since i''ve learned more and more... i''ve gotta say this shot truly is awesome. To say the least you fully nailed "in the style of HCB" and i''m writing this now because i am starting to finally understand what that means. thank you.</td>', 'ok it''s been more than a year since this challenge but this photo has always been rattling around in my head, especially since i''ve learned more and more... i''ve gotta say this shot truly is awesome. To say the least you fully nailed "in the style of HCB" and i''m writing this now because i am starting to finally understand what that means. thank you.', '2012-06-03 20:17:33.000000', NULL, 0),
